# Firestore Data Modeling Rules

## PeakActivity Firestore Data Model

This document defines the Firestore database structure, collections, document schemas, and security rules for the PeakActivity project.

### Main Collection Structure

```
firestore/
├── users/                           # User profiles
│   └── {userId}/
│       ├── activities/              # User activities
│       ├── goals/                   # Goals
│       ├── insights/                # AI-generated insights
│       ├── daily_reports/           # Daily reports
│       ├── weekly_reports/          # Weekly reports
│       ├── automation_rules/        # User-defined rules
│       └── settings/                # Custom settings
├── teams/                           # Team information (Pro tier)
├── subscriptions/                   # Subscription information
├── app_categories/                  # Application category cache
├── system_insights/                 # System-wide insights
├── performance_metrics/             # Performance metrics
├── error_logs/                      # Error logs
└── analytics_events/                # Analytics events
```

